    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="51">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 51</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be siblegere. Gyf hwa sibleger gewyrce, gebete þæt be sibbe mæðe, swa be were swa be wite swa be ealre æhta.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning incest. If anyone commits incest, he shall make amends according to the degree of relationship [between them], either by the payment of wergeld or of a fine, or by the forfeiture of all his possessions.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa sibleger gewyrce, gebete þæt be sibbe mæðe, swa be were swa be wite swa be ealre æhte.</ab>
      </div>
